*_FIX.md
*_SUMMARY.md
*_GUIDE.md
*_REPORT.md
*_CHECKLIST.md
*_IMPLEMENTATION.md
*_VERIFICATION.md
*_TEST_GUIDE.md
*_COMPLETE.md
PHASE_*.md
